{"id": "t050-003", "text": "Called Gustavo. His dad had a fall last weekend and is in hospital for at least another week, they're saying hip replacement probably but nobody's confirmed anything. Gus sounds knackered, he's been driving up every evening after work and then working late to catch up. His partner's holding the fort at home with the dog. I should offer to drop a meal round.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Gustavo", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "fall", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "last weekend", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "in hospital", "fact_type": "health", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "at least another week"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "hip replacement", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Gus", "pronoun": "he", "same_as": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "knackered", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "every evening after work"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "partner", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "dog", "fact_type": "pet", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "offer to drop a meal round", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "after", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t050-004", "text": "Ayesha turns 30 on 2 November 2026. Big party planned at her sister's place, fancy dress, theme is the nineties. She's obsessed with that Korean skincare brand at the moment, the one with the snail stuff, could get a set. Also mentioned she's been wanting a silk pillowcase forever. Ask Jada if she wants to go halves.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ayesha", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "turns 30", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "2 November 2026", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Big party", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "sister", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "Korean skincare brand", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "wanting a silk pillowcase", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Ask Jada if she wants to go halves", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jada", "pronoun": "she"}]}
{"id": "t050-007", "text": "Jen's off work for a while after her gallbladder surgery, recovery's slower than they said. Her husband's doing all the school runs.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jen", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "off work", "fact_type": "job", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "a while"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "gallbladder surgery", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "recovery", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "husband", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t050-009", "text": "So, um, just got off the phone with Caroline, she said Pooja's moving to Leeds in the spring, not sure exactly when, and they're doing a leaving dinner for her probably end of March. I should ask Caroline what the plan is for a group gift.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Caroline", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Pooja", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moving to Leeds", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in the spring", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "leaving dinner", "event_type": "party", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "probably end of March", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask Caroline what the plan is for a group gift", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Caroline", "pronoun": "she"}]}
{"id": "t050-011", "text": "Yosef's daughter Nia has her tonsils out on Thursday. She's six and really scared about it. Must send her something silly, she loves dinosaurs.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Yosef", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "daughter", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Nia", "pronoun": "she", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "tonsils out", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Thursday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "six", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "scared", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send her something silly", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "dinosaurs", "owner": "p2"}]}
{"id": "t050-014", "text": "Ran into Jorge at the shop. Back's still bad after the physio, he's got another appointment after Christmas. Seemed fed up.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jorge", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "Back's still bad", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "physio", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "appointment", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "after Christmas", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "fed up", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t050-020", "text": "Ok so Joy says the twins start nursery in January, probably the second week, she wasn't sure. She's way more nervous about the drop-off than they are, she said she'll probably cry in the car park. Her husband can't take time off so she's doing the first few days on her own. Their older one, Pedro, is apparently thrilled to have the house back to himself.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Joy", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "twins", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "nursery", "event_type": "school", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in January", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "probably the second week", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "nervous about the drop-off", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "husband", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the first few days", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "older one", "fact_type": "relationship", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Pedro", "pronoun": "he", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "thrilled to have the house back to himself", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p2"}]}
{"id": "t050-023", "text": "Spoke to Ahmed today. His wife Laila had her baby on Monday, a little girl, both doing well. Need to send a card and maybe drop round some food next week once they've settled.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ahmed", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "today"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "wife", "fact_type": "relationship", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Laila", "pronoun": "she", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "baby", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send a card", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "after", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "drop round some food", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "after", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "next week", "anchor": "a2"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "once they've settled", "anchor": "a2"}]}
{"id": "t050-024", "text": "Abigail's surgery went fine yesterday, she's home already. ask how the first week of recovery goes", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Abigail", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "surgery", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "yesterday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask how the first week of recovery goes", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the first week", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "recovery", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t050-026", "text": "Pedro's got an MRI on 11/18 for the headaches. Doesn't want a fuss. I'll check in after quietly.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Pedro", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "MRI", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "11/18", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "headaches", "fact_type": "health", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "Doesn't want a fuss", "fact_type": "other", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "after", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t050-027", "text": "emily and her brother Connor are throwing their parents a surprise 40th anniversary thing in the summer, date tbc. emily wants me to bake", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "emily", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "fact_type": "relationship", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Connor", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "parents", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "surprise 40th anniversary thing", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in the summer", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "emily", "pronoun": "she"}]}
{"id": "t050-028", "text": "Amara's cat Biscuit had emergency surgery tonight for a blocked bladder and has to stay at the vet overnight, maybe two nights. She's in bits, she's had him since uni. The bill is going to be enormous as well and she's only just started her new job at the library so money's tight. Message her tomorrow morning to see how he's doing.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Amara", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "cat Biscuit", "fact_type": "pet", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "emergency surgery", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "tonight", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "overnight"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "maybe two nights"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "in bits", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "since uni"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "new job at the library", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "money's tight", "fact_type": "other", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Message her", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "after", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "tomorrow morning", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t050-029", "text": "Phone call with Gustavo again. Dad's out of hospital as of Tuesday, staying with Gus and his partner for a few weeks while he gets back on his feet. Gus is sleeping on the sofa basically.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Gustavo", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "Dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "out of hospital", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "as of Tuesday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Gus", "pronoun": "he", "same_as": "p1"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "partner", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "a few weeks"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "while he gets back on his feet"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Gus", "pronoun": "he", "same_as": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t050-031", "text": "Jada's op went ahead on the 14th, all good apparently. Remind me to ask her how the physio is going.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jada", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "op", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 14th", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask her how the physio is going", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "physio", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}]}
{"id": "t050-034", "text": "Imogen's out of hospital. Sore but cheerful, already complaining about hospital food and asking for proper coffee. She's off work till at least mid-May, possibly longer if the stitches play up. Her mum's come down from Edinburgh to stay for a fortnight. I'm going round on Sunday with magazines and the good biscuits.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Imogen", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "out of hospital", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "Sore", "fact_type": "health", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "cheerful", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "proper coffee", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "off work", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "till at least mid-May", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "from Edinburgh", "fact_type": "home", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "a fortnight"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sunday"}]}
{"id": "t050-036", "text": "Kwame starts his new job at the council after half term, the 3rd I think. He's a bit nervous about the commute, it's two trains and a bus, and his manager sounds intense. Chioma's chuffed for him though, he's been wanting out of the warehouse for ages. Don't forget to text him on his first day.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kwame", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "new job at the council", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "after half term", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 3rd", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "a bit nervous about the commute", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "manager", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Chioma", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "chuffed", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "text him", "action_type": "message", "timing": "on", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "his first day", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t050-037", "text": "Dr Fischer said Emre's mum needs a second biopsy, so it's dragging on into the new year. Emre is not coping great honestly, he's barely sleeping and his boss isn't being very understanding. I need to call him this week, properly, not just a text.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dr Fischer", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Emre", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "second biopsy", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "into the new year", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Emre", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "not coping great", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "barely sleeping", "fact_type": "health", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "boss", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "call him", "action_type": "call", "timing": "before", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "this week", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t050-038", "text": "Pooja's leaving dinner is March 28. Her favourite thing is matcha anything. Caroline's collecting for a gift.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Pooja", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "leaving dinner", "event_type": "party", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "March 28", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "matcha", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Caroline", "pronoun": "unknown"}]}
{"id": "t050-039", "text": "Bethany's mum is having a hysterectomy in February, Beth's taking a week off to look after her.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Bethany", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "hysterectomy", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in February", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Beth", "pronoun": "unknown", "same_as": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "taking a week off", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "check_in"}]}
{"id": "t050-042", "text": "Jorge's sister is getting married 5/22 in Seville, the whole family's flying out the week before. He's best man and dreading the speech.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jorge", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "sister", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "getting married", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "congratulate", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "5/22", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "family", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flying out", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "r2"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the week before", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "best man", "fact_type": "other", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "dreading", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "speech", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "wish_luck", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t050-043", "text": "Long chat with Dimitri. Wife's had some bleeding so she's on bed rest for now, scan on Friday to check everything's okay. He's trying to work from home as much as possible. Asked me not to mention it to the others yet. I should check in with him Friday evening after the scan.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dimitri", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "Wife", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "bleeding", "fact_type": "health", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "on bed rest", "fact_type": "health", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "scan", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "check in with him", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "after", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday evening after the scan", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t050-047", "text": "Kate's teeth done, face like a hamster lol. All fine. Off work till Monday.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kate", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "teeth done", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Off work", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "till Monday", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t050-048", "text": "Chioma's been signed off with burnout for a month, from November 1st. Doesn't want visitors but said messages are fine.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Chioma", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "signed off with burnout", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "a month", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "from November 1st", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "Doesn't want visitors", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}]}
{"id": "t050-050", "text": "Pedro's MRI was clear, he's relieved. Back to football next week.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Pedro", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "MRI", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "relieved", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Back to football", "event_type": "other", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next week", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t050-052", "text": "Dong's mum has a hip replacement scheduled for 17 January 2027 and Dong is flying back to Shanghai for a month to help out with her recovery. He leaves on the 10th. Text him before he goes.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dong", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "hip replacement", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "17 January 2027", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dong", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flying back to Shanghai", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "a month", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "recovery", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 10th", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Text him", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "message", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "before he goes", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t050-054", "text": "Emily's brother Connor has his appendix out tonight, emergency. Emily's going to the hospital now. Don't know much more.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Emily", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Connor", "pronoun": "he", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "appendix out", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "tonight", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Emily", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "now"}]}
{"id": "t050-057", "text": "Jen texted back, she's going back to work part time from next month, three days a week to start with. Says she's tired but getting there, still can't lift anything heavy. She's got really into audiobooks while recovering, mostly long fantasy series, she's halfway through the Wheel of Time. Might get her an Audible credit or two, her birthday's sometime in the autumn anyway.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jen", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "going back to work part time", "event_type": "job", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "from next month", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "three days a week", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "tired", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "getting there", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "can't lift anything heavy", "fact_type": "health", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "audiobooks", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "while recovering"}, {"id": "i2", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "long fantasy series", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i3", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "Wheel of Time", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "birthday", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime in the autumn", "anchor": "e2"}]}
